OL,3,GNEWSAHarry Potter filming 'cuts off'
OL,4,Avillagers
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in a village said they
OL,7,Fhad been "cut off" after roads were
OL,8,Fclosed while a production company
OL,9,Finvolved in the new Harry Potter series
OL,10,Ffilmed there.
OL,12,FResidents of Latimer, Buckinghamshire,
OL,13,Fwere notified in September that Plum
OL,14,FJam Productions, a subsidiary of Warner
OL,15,FBros. Discovery, would be filming a
OL,16,Fmajor HBO series in the village later
OL,17,Fthat month.
OL,19,FRestrictions were put in place for
OL,20,F28-30 September, including the closure
OL,21,Fof all routes into the village centre
OL,22,Fon Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
